<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tasek Cement net up 13.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tasek Cement net up 13.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		48.97	vs	 43.01</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     32.7	 vs	 28.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 292.80	vs	256.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  60.07	vs	 53.71</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  0.58	vs	  0.53</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)     15.0	 vs	 15.0</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of company is Tasek Cement Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
